stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : create (any role)
    PENDING --> CONFIRMED : CONFIRM (Host, Admin)
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : CANCEL (Host, Admin)
    CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : CHECK_IN (Staff, Host, Admin)
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : CANCEL (Host, Admin)
    CHECKED_IN --> CHECKED_OUT : CHECK_OUT (Staff, Host, Admin)
    CHECKED_OUT --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    note right of CONFIRMED : editable while PENDING or CONFIRMED
